  "problem": "Which expression is equivalent to $(P\u2227M)\u2228Q?$",
  "worked_solution": "By the commutative law, $P\u2227M\u2261M\u2227P.$\n\nTherefore, $(P\u2227M)\u2228Q\u2261(M\u2227P)\u2228Q.$\n\nFinally, by the commutative law, we have\n\n$$\n(M\u2227P)\u2228Q\u2261Q\u2228(M\u2227P).\n$$",
